            P("People who can't see a private space get *not found* rather than *no access*, so its name doesn't leak. Requests without a sign-in get *not signed in* for anything they can't read. Super admins see every space."),
            P("A space can only be made **public** while a super admin has turned on **Settings → Security → Anonymous access** (see [Users & directories](users-and-directories.html#anonymous-access)). If anonymous access is turned off later, public spaces stay public, but only signed-in people can read them until it's back on."),
