            H("Repositories"),
            P("A space opens on its **Overview**: its description; the same figures with how they split (hosted, proxy and group repositories; people, groups and service accounts; what was published last and by whom); **Recently published**; **Needs attention** (versions held in quarantine, storage nearly full, upstreams proxy repositories can't reach), its formats and its upstreams. **Browse artifacts** at the top opens the browser on this space. Its tabs are **Repositories**, **Members**, **Quarantine** (with the number of versions held now) and **Settings**. The **Repositories** tab is a table you can filter by name, format and type, with each repository's size and when something was last published; proxy repositories whose upstream can't be reached say so (they keep serving what they have cached). Below it, each format's universal URL and default group. Maintainers and owners (and super admins) choose **New repository**, give it a name (lowercase letters, digits, dots, dashes and underscores; unique within the space; not a format's name such as `maven` or `npm`, which are the universal URLs), pick one of the space's formats and a type:"),
