            P("Select a repository to open it. **Browse** shows its folders and files. Selecting a file that belongs to a version opens that version in the [artifact browser](browse.html), where its **Files** tab has each file's details, checksums and delete; other files (indexes and metadata) show their size, downloads and checksums (SHA-256, SHA-1, MD5, SHA-512) in a dialog, with delete. **Versions** lists its versions."),
